## Why This Is Asked
Tests memory lifecycle and concurrency safety when crossing the Go/C boundary. Requires safe copying, explicit freeing, and avoidance of Go pointers in C.

## Key Concepts
- CGO memory management
- Safe cross-language data transfer
- Concurrency and race avoidance

## Code Example
